      "notes": "18 holes beside Exile Bay, par 66 (women 68: holes 1 and 18 are par 5 for women). Blue tees 4525m; GolfFinder also lists white 4312m and red 4366m, but no hole-by-hole lengths for those. Green fees are for 18 holes, any day (from 1 July 2026): 9 holes $30.50, twilight $25. Book online (MiClub public bookings) or call the pro shop, 02 9743 3737; same-day bookings and cancellations by phone. Hole 18a is a spare hole used when another is out for maintenance; not on the card here. Stroke index from Hole19. The club's course guide calls the 1st the toughest hole and the 7th the easiest, which matches Hole19 (SI 1 and 18); 18Birdies has a different order (1st = 2, 18th = 1) and conflicts with the club on both. No handicap rating stored: none published by Golf Australia was found. Seen elsewhere: 63.5 / 113 (18Birdies, men, these tees), 63.0 / 113 (a forum handicap post), slope 117-119 (GolfFinder). Take the scratch rating and slope from the card or GolfLink.",
